XYZ — Machine Learning Prediction Challenge
RULEBOOK v1.0
==========================================

1. ELIGIBILITY
   - Open to all enrolled undergraduate and postgraduate students.
   - Teams of up to 3 members permitted.

2. SUBMISSION FORMAT
   - Jupyter Notebook (.ipynb) with full code.
   - Predictions CSV file.
   - Short report (max 4 pages PDF).

3. EVALUATION CRITERIA
   - Technical Score (70%): Model performance on held-out test set.
   - Presentation Score (30%): Methodology, clarity, insights.

4. RULES
   - No pre-trained LLMs on competition data.
   - External public datasets allowed (declare in report).
   - No sharing of solutions between teams.

5. DEADLINES
   - Submission: Sep 5, 2026, 23:59 IST
   - Presentations: Sep 10, 2026

6. CONTACT
   Email: dac@college.edu

